@sivel 

The expire option changes the 'Account expires' parameter, not 'Password expires'. I'd like to disable maximum number of days between changing the password for system accounts or user with ssh keys. Currently it's not possible with one task while creating a user. 

I think that operations on the shadow file should be the basic function of user_module. At the moment I have to use the shell_module or external module like https://github.com/lqueryvg/ansible-role-chage.
